WEBVTT

00:00.480 --> 00:03.690
Three Years Ago

00:04.060 --> 00:05.150
Yes.

00:05.150 --> 00:08.440
She has a unity rating of
88.7% with her Regalia.

00:09.320 --> 00:12.030
It would seem our superiors want to make her your partner.

00:12.030 --> 00:13.000
Train her well.

00:13.490 --> 00:15.070
If it's an order.

00:24.250 --> 00:25.380
Don't pray.

00:25.830 --> 00:28.170
We are the Anti-Creed of Fatima.

00:28.670 --> 00:31.210
It's not God's salvation we seek.

00:31.210 --> 00:33.630
We perform miracles in God's stead.

00:36.050 --> 00:39.010
I wasn't praying, I was giving thanks.

00:40.850 --> 00:45.200
Thanks to God that the power He has bestowed upon me can be used to save so many.

00:46.100 --> 00:47.310
Feelings like those are—

00:47.310 --> 00:49.200
I'm Flors Oriens.

00:50.780 --> 00:53.190
Clarus Tonitrus.

00:54.280 --> 00:59.030
Clarus-senpai, unskilled as I may be,
I look forward to learning from you.

01:00.080 --> 01:02.790
<i>That was how I met Flors Oriens.</i>

01:04.910 --> 01:08.250
<i>My partner for but half a year.</i>

02:39.970 --> 02:41.970
Wh-Who are you?

02:47.760 --> 02:49.300
That bracelet!

02:49.730 --> 02:51.900
Creed Killer, you bastard!

02:51.900 --> 02:53.060
What is she talking about?

02:53.060 --> 02:55.440
The natural enemy to all of Fatima.

02:59.990 --> 03:01.410
I've waited so long for this!

03:02.070 --> 03:03.870
The moment I would finally meet you.

03:04.160 --> 03:06.240
Calm your tits, missy.

03:06.240 --> 03:08.040
Sobbin' and screamin'll get you nowhere,

03:08.040 --> 03:10.750
'cause you'll be a part of my collection soon enough.

03:11.500 --> 03:12.460
That's...

03:13.910 --> 03:16.090
I won't forgive you!

03:18.200 --> 03:20.380
Stand down! It's too dangerous!

03:20.380 --> 03:22.180
You're not powerful enough to defeat him!

03:22.840 --> 03:24.220
I assure you, I will!

03:24.220 --> 03:26.060
This is the mission of Anti-Creed!

03:27.760 --> 03:29.180
This is <i>my</i> mission!

03:33.900 --> 03:36.190
I'll dispose of you later, missy.

03:36.610 --> 03:39.070
Wait your turn like a good lil' girl.

03:39.070 --> 03:41.150
For now,

03:41.610 --> 03:43.280
I have business with this little one.

03:44.280 --> 03:45.620
M-Me?

03:46.030 --> 03:47.330
With Toi-san?

03:48.450 --> 03:49.620
Stop!

03:50.910 --> 03:53.250
Why are you targeting her?

03:53.830 --> 03:57.250
Seriously now, you expect me to answer that?

03:57.250 --> 03:59.010
Mine own foe...

03:59.550 --> 04:03.840
without love, without mercy,
and without pity.

04:04.680 --> 04:05.680
Such a life leads...

04:05.680 --> 04:08.310
..."down the path of destruction," huh!?

04:12.390 --> 04:13.300
Clarus!

04:13.850 --> 04:14.480
wait—

04:23.610 --> 04:24.410
Stop!

04:24.410 --> 04:26.120
Watch out!

04:38.040 --> 04:40.550
Now that's how it's done!

04:40.550 --> 04:42.510
Let's go, Drec.

04:43.670 --> 04:46.800
We've got ourselves a fun little hunt.

04:51.350 --> 04:53.560
Where did they go?

04:54.020 --> 04:56.190
She opened the Gate of Caelum?

04:56.810 --> 04:58.650
A door between dimensions?

04:59.400 --> 05:00.980
You mean a higher dimension?

05:06.530 --> 05:09.200
Toi-san, where are we?

05:09.200 --> 05:11.950
I don't know either.

05:11.950 --> 05:14.250
But you're the one who
brought us here, right, Toi-san?

05:14.250 --> 05:16.250
D-Did I?

05:17.250 --> 05:21.750
It looks like the same place as the bank.

05:22.420 --> 05:23.710
Why?

05:24.590 --> 05:27.390
Why did you open the Gate of Caelum?

05:27.390 --> 05:28.050
Caelum?

05:28.430 --> 05:30.430
Why did you interfere?

05:30.430 --> 05:33.760
I've been waiting so long to fight with the Creed Killer!

05:33.760 --> 05:36.770
So, so long...

05:38.150 --> 05:39.810
Hang in there!

05:40.520 --> 05:42.510
Looks like she's taking a nap.

05:42.730 --> 05:46.110
Why is she pushing herself this hard?

05:46.110 --> 05:48.780
How's the tea party goin', girlies?

05:49.780 --> 05:51.870
Let me join in on the fun, too!

05:51.870 --> 05:53.080
He's here!

05:53.080 --> 05:55.580
Gross dudes pretending to be
gentlemen aren't allowed in!

05:55.580 --> 05:56.620
How rude.

05:56.620 --> 05:57.710
Yuma-chan!

05:57.710 --> 05:59.710
How about this fine gentleman, then?

06:03.130 --> 06:04.510
You kidding me?

06:04.510 --> 06:07.130
The brat went even higher now?

06:07.630 --> 06:10.390
She's got a strong one clothing her.

06:11.430 --> 06:13.220
Wha—again!?

06:14.520 --> 06:17.230
Her Resolution And My Reason!

06:21.940 --> 06:23.270
Wait!

06:24.070 --> 06:25.360
Wait a second!

06:26.780 --> 06:27.450
What?

06:28.070 --> 06:30.750
Why does Fatima have
Matoi under surveillance?

06:31.160 --> 06:33.830
What is it that the Nights want from her?

06:35.290 --> 06:39.120
If we exchange what we know,
we might reach some kind of resolution.

06:39.120 --> 06:41.750
What can an organization that can't achieve Divine Union do?

06:43.750 --> 06:44.590
Wai—

06:53.050 --> 06:53.890
It's Luciela.

06:56.720 --> 06:58.800
Clarus hasn't released herself from Divine Union yet.

06:59.350 --> 07:01.800
So she still intends to fight

07:02.690 --> 07:04.270
even with her injuries?

07:06.280 --> 07:10.360
<i>It had been three months since
Flors Oriens and I became partners.</i>

07:18.330 --> 07:19.750
The Gate of Caelum has closed.

07:20.790 --> 07:23.460
It seems you have purged all the Nights from this area.

07:23.460 --> 07:24.040
Good.

07:24.040 --> 07:25.170
Hang on!

07:25.590 --> 07:27.420
Please hang on!

07:27.420 --> 07:29.380
Flors-san, how many times
do I have to tell you?

07:30.090 --> 07:33.840
Nights possess humans in order to traverse this world.

07:33.840 --> 07:36.100
And by doing so, they steal
the energy that sustains us.

07:36.470 --> 07:39.350
The victim's mind crumbles away,
and they'll never be the same again.

07:40.060 --> 07:43.700
And the only way to keep the number of victims from rising is to destroy the Nights themselves.

07:44.400 --> 07:47.650
I don't think that's what God wants.

07:47.650 --> 07:48.280
Huh?

07:48.280 --> 07:50.150
Nights are beings from higher dimensions!

07:50.150 --> 07:54.200
They deserve God's blessing just as much as we do!

07:54.410 --> 07:57.030
Flors-san, what are you saying?

07:57.030 --> 08:02.830
I just cannot believe that the power God has
entrusted us with can only be used to fight.

08:03.460 --> 08:04.420
That's just...

08:05.420 --> 08:07.470
That's just tragic!

08:08.130 --> 08:10.460
Flors-san, I—

08:10.460 --> 08:12.630
Clarus, what are you doing?

08:12.630 --> 08:13.800
Return immediately.

08:16.260 --> 08:17.470
Clarus.

08:18.600 --> 08:19.570
Roger.

08:20.980 --> 08:24.100
I... don't want to lose you,

08:24.810 --> 08:25.900
Flors-san.

08:29.280 --> 08:31.200
Are you awake?

08:33.280 --> 08:34.200
You...

08:35.320 --> 08:38.660
I'm jealous of Yuma-chan, sleeping in a situation like this without a care in the world.

08:40.660 --> 08:43.360
But more importantly, where is this place?

08:43.360 --> 08:46.670
When the demon attacked, all I could
think was, "We need to get out of here."

08:46.670 --> 08:47.960
And then all of a sudden, we were here.

08:47.960 --> 08:49.590
There's still time.

08:50.500 --> 08:53.420
And my powers are returning to me.

08:53.420 --> 08:54.180
If I can—

08:54.180 --> 08:55.680
I hope I'm wrong,

08:56.430 --> 08:58.680
but are you still planning
on fighting that demon?

08:59.470 --> 09:01.280
This doesn't concern you.

09:01.680 --> 09:05.100
But it seemed like I was the one he was after.

09:05.100 --> 09:08.730
I don't even understand why, either.

09:08.730 --> 09:09.650
Oh!

09:10.110 --> 09:12.110
I forgot to introduce myself.

09:12.110 --> 09:14.200
I'm Sumeragi Matoi.

09:16.160 --> 09:17.910
<i>I'm Flors Oriens.</i>

09:18.950 --> 09:20.910
Well, uh, thank you.

09:21.540 --> 09:25.830
I never thanked you for saving me earlier, so...

09:25.830 --> 09:28.330
If you wish to show your gratitude,

09:28.330 --> 09:30.000
then remain with me for a while longer.

09:30.750 --> 09:33.960
If I'm with you, the Creed Killer will appear.

09:34.670 --> 09:37.550
So you really <i>are</i> going to fight him again.

09:38.390 --> 09:39.430
Why?

09:39.430 --> 09:40.890
Of course I am.

09:40.890 --> 09:42.930
I have my reasons.

09:43.850 --> 09:47.690
And I'm prepared to do whatever I must!

09:47.690 --> 09:50.110
Shaddup, wood ya...

09:50.860 --> 09:54.000
I never thought I would have to say these words again, but...

09:54.820 --> 09:57.950
Please, stay with me.

09:57.950 --> 09:59.640
Let me have my revenge!

09:59.990 --> 10:01.240
Your revenge?

10:05.910 --> 10:07.160
I understand.

10:08.790 --> 10:10.250
I'll stay here.

10:10.250 --> 10:13.580
I'm scared, but I can't leave you here alone.

10:14.690 --> 10:15.390
Um...

10:15.710 --> 10:21.000
But while we're waiting, could you explain my god,
these demons, and everything else to me?

10:21.640 --> 10:24.600
I'm flying blind here,

10:24.600 --> 10:26.630
and that's what really scares me.

10:27.270 --> 10:28.350
All right.

10:29.400 --> 10:31.650
I won't go into too much detail,
but I'll tell you what I can.

10:32.360 --> 10:34.610
Yes, Clarus is handling it.

10:35.650 --> 10:38.650
But she is up against two High Nights.

10:38.650 --> 10:41.820
And one of them happens to be the Creed Killer.

10:42.740 --> 10:44.910
No, I understand.

10:44.910 --> 10:47.120
We shall handle it without assistance.

10:49.370 --> 10:50.920
Not that we have a choice anyway.

10:50.920 --> 10:54.420
Clarus is too stubborn to work with anyone else.

10:57.460 --> 10:58.720
Clarus.

10:58.720 --> 11:00.470
About the candidate to be your new partner—

11:00.470 --> 11:01.800
I don't need a new partner.

11:02.430 --> 11:04.600
So you intend to keep fighting the Nights alone?

11:05.310 --> 11:08.480
I don't care if it's more work for me,

11:08.480 --> 11:10.690
or what the others think.

11:10.690 --> 11:11.770
Clarus.

11:11.770 --> 11:13.940
I am an Anti-Creed of Fatima.

11:14.520 --> 11:17.440
I will devote everything I have to the destruction of Nights.

11:18.990 --> 11:20.360
She hasn't smiled

11:21.570 --> 11:23.780
ever since that day.

11:23.780 --> 11:28.000
It's like every fiber of her being has been poured into her hatred for the Nights.

11:32.960 --> 11:35.460
Intelligent life from a higher dimension?

11:35.960 --> 11:37.340
Just as Shinto priests

11:37.340 --> 11:40.420
have for centuries used rituals to summon beings from a higher dimension,

11:40.420 --> 11:44.140
we can gain transcendental powers by submitting our bodies to "gods."

11:44.760 --> 11:47.760
That is what we call a Divine Union.

11:48.600 --> 11:49.970
Divine Union...

11:50.310 --> 11:53.480
We've formed a union with these higher dimensional beings,

11:53.480 --> 11:56.400
but those Nights that you call "demons" are different.

11:57.020 --> 12:00.740
They possess people by force and manipulate them at will.

12:01.360 --> 12:02.650
Those demons...

12:02.650 --> 12:07.330
Uh, Nights, must come to our world for a reason.

12:07.330 --> 12:08.530
I don't know.

12:08.530 --> 12:11.790
You don't know, and yet you still fight?

12:11.790 --> 12:14.370
If a spark lands on you,
do you brush it away or let it burn?

12:15.000 --> 12:19.250
And there's no way to resolve it peacefully?
You can't reason with them?

12:19.250 --> 12:21.300
If that was possible,
there wouldn't still be suffering.

12:21.300 --> 12:23.340
I guess so.

12:24.010 --> 12:27.430
Why did <i>I</i> get this power?

12:28.350 --> 12:31.680
I'm just an ordinary girl. I'm no one special.

12:31.680 --> 12:34.000
There must be a reason.

12:34.480 --> 12:36.350
<i>I think there's a reason.</i>

12:37.940 --> 12:42.530
There has to be another reason God gave us this power!

12:42.530 --> 12:44.240
Another way to use it besides fighting!

12:44.650 --> 12:47.160
Again with this, Flors-san?

12:47.160 --> 12:49.700
But I want to find it!

12:50.280 --> 12:51.830
The Gate of Caelum has opened.

12:52.580 --> 12:53.540
We're moving out.

13:06.720 --> 13:08.510
Where's Flors-san?

13:13.600 --> 13:14.430
That's...

13:15.640 --> 13:17.100
Creed Killer!

13:17.400 --> 13:19.400
Flors-san, get away from him!

13:26.030 --> 13:26.950
Flors-san?

13:27.360 --> 13:29.700
Wait, Clarus-senpai. Please.

13:30.160 --> 13:32.290
I want to talk to him.

13:33.540 --> 13:35.370
I know there's a way to resolve our differences.

13:36.370 --> 13:38.830
I know there is.

13:53.310 --> 13:55.500
Not today.

14:10.660 --> 14:13.240
Flors-san!

14:15.500 --> 14:17.790
He opened a strong gravitational field inside of her body.

14:18.710 --> 14:23.210
Her organs and circulation were temporarily halted,

14:23.210 --> 14:25.600
and she sustained severe brain damage.

14:26.010 --> 14:28.550
Her Divine Union saved her life,

14:28.550 --> 14:30.260
but wielding a Regalia is
now out of the question.

14:30.260 --> 14:31.700
Unfortunately, her life is forf—

14:30.980 --> 14:32.720
I know.

14:33.010 --> 14:34.890
Flors-san was weak.

14:34.890 --> 14:38.680
She was weak, so she clung to hope and impossible dreams.

14:39.730 --> 14:42.300
Flors, that was your sin.

14:43.060 --> 14:45.000
And my sin...

14:45.440 --> 14:47.690
was opening my heart too much to you.

14:48.650 --> 14:50.740
And not being able to protect you.

14:53.410 --> 14:54.530
Clarus...

14:57.500 --> 14:59.710
Don't worry, Flors-san.

14:59.710 --> 15:01.500
I won't make any more mistakes.

15:02.080 --> 15:04.540
And especially not another one like this.

15:06.750 --> 15:08.510
Hey, uh...

15:09.840 --> 15:11.300
Um...

15:11.300 --> 15:16.010
What makes you think <i>I</i> would know why you're able to achieve Divine Union?

15:16.720 --> 15:20.480
The intentions of the Nights aside, you seriously believe this can be resolved peacefully!?

15:20.480 --> 15:21.980
Quit talking nonsense!

15:22.520 --> 15:23.860
We have to fight!

15:25.260 --> 15:27.230
Nights are the enemy of humanity!

15:28.230 --> 15:30.190
We cannot permit their existence.

15:35.780 --> 15:38.910
If you're not prepared to fight, that's fine.

15:38.910 --> 15:41.570
But stay out of my way!

15:46.000 --> 15:47.740
H-He's here!

15:48.630 --> 15:50.670
Spunky, ain't ya?

15:51.420 --> 15:52.930
What a worthwhile hunt.

15:53.720 --> 15:56.680
That's my line!

15:58.890 --> 16:00.850
Oh, I like you.

16:07.020 --> 16:08.150
You've done enough,

16:08.150 --> 16:08.900
now run!

16:08.900 --> 16:09.940
Huh?

16:09.940 --> 16:11.740
Don't forget that you're the one he's after.

16:12.110 --> 16:15.240
I can't fight him and protect you at the same time.

16:15.620 --> 16:16.740
Let's book it, Toi-san!

16:16.740 --> 16:18.910
As fast as our legs can carry us!

16:18.910 --> 16:19.870
B-But...

16:19.870 --> 16:20.950
She's fine!

16:21.830 --> 16:23.330
Hey, hey, hey.

16:23.330 --> 16:25.710
I'm gettin' tired of playin' tag.

16:28.000 --> 16:29.170
You're not going anywhere!

16:31.630 --> 16:33.720
Take care of her.

16:38.140 --> 16:40.350
You can't keep using the same tricks on me.

16:48.060 --> 16:52.940
You're not the only one who's stronger in this dimension.

17:03.000 --> 17:04.870
Disappear from this world!

17:19.890 --> 17:22.850
Hey, hey, hey, hey, hey!

17:22.850 --> 17:27.140
Now you've done it, Anti-Creed!

17:30.150 --> 17:31.690
The space is distorting!?

17:36.110 --> 17:37.450
I'm falling!

17:37.450 --> 17:39.450
Yuma-chan!

17:46.210 --> 17:49.670
Fall, fall, fall!

17:56.510 --> 17:58.090
A DR reaction.

17:59.840 --> 18:02.050
Are they back?

18:05.220 --> 18:06.270
Clarus.

18:11.150 --> 18:12.770
We're falling, we're falling!

18:12.770 --> 18:14.810
When people fall, they die!

18:14.810 --> 18:16.740
H-Help me, Shingo!

18:16.740 --> 18:19.760
At least save Yuma-chan!

18:25.950 --> 18:27.460
Toi-san, you're cool!

18:27.460 --> 18:30.170
You're flying! We're flying!

18:30.170 --> 18:32.500
Thank God we've stopped.

18:38.130 --> 18:39.050
That girl!

18:39.050 --> 18:41.680
She's gonna go splat like that!

18:41.680 --> 18:43.010
Yuma-chan,

18:43.390 --> 18:44.510
can I go save her?

18:44.850 --> 18:46.350
Of course you can.

18:46.350 --> 18:47.590
If you don't,

18:47.590 --> 18:49.850
it'll shame the Exorcist Girl's good name!

18:52.020 --> 18:55.520
I'll bring you a glorious death, sweet cheeks!

19:04.530 --> 19:06.120
Are you okay?

19:06.660 --> 19:08.000
Why are you helping me?

19:08.700 --> 19:10.500
You have no reason to fight.

19:10.500 --> 19:11.830
I do!

19:11.830 --> 19:14.840
I wanted to help you!

19:14.840 --> 19:17.200
Is that wrong?

19:18.550 --> 19:21.470
And you never told me your name.

19:21.470 --> 19:24.430
Toi-san, you can talk later. We should land first.

19:24.430 --> 19:25.350
Okay.

19:30.520 --> 19:33.020
This is what they call a "surprise counterattack"!

19:34.860 --> 19:37.860
There won't even be dust left over when I'm done with you.

19:38.610 --> 19:39.740
That's...

19:42.150 --> 19:44.320
What a strong gravitational field!

19:49.620 --> 19:50.790
They're still battling?

19:50.790 --> 19:52.500
Matoi-san! Yuma-san!

19:52.500 --> 19:53.790
Luciela-sensei!

19:53.790 --> 19:55.080
Don't come any closer!

19:55.080 --> 19:56.170
Run!

19:56.170 --> 19:58.170
Say goodbye, children!

20:02.610 --> 20:03.560
What?

20:03.840 --> 20:06.720
Wh-What is that?

20:28.280 --> 20:29.700
All the gods are....

20:30.830 --> 20:32.660
They're coming together.

20:35.370 --> 20:36.920
Is she summoning them?

20:37.670 --> 20:40.090
It's the unique notion of the Shinto religion

20:40.090 --> 20:41.800
that gods exist within all of creation.

20:43.590 --> 20:45.800
A myriad of gods.

20:47.600 --> 20:50.510
Because I want to protect everyone!

20:51.180 --> 20:54.390
Because I want to help everyone!

21:03.030 --> 21:04.530
Did she just...

21:04.530 --> 21:06.450
Mine own foe

21:06.910 --> 21:10.450
without love, without mercy,
and without pity.

21:11.410 --> 21:14.040
Such a life leads

21:14.410 --> 21:15.160
Huh?

21:19.460 --> 21:20.500
down the path of destruction!

21:22.510 --> 21:24.970
Damn it. Set, you bastard.

21:24.970 --> 21:27.510
Pushing an impossible task on me.

21:28.430 --> 21:31.930
Is this what you wanted to see!?

21:43.230 --> 21:46.240
I-I defeated him!

21:46.990 --> 21:48.320
Flors-san!

21:49.370 --> 21:50.950
H-Hey!

21:50.950 --> 21:53.830
Why do you always push yourself so hard?

21:54.200 --> 21:57.410
Because that's who I am.

21:59.830 --> 22:02.700
I had decided to do this alone, yet...

22:03.210 --> 22:04.630
Um...

22:05.300 --> 22:07.470
Are you angry about something?

22:07.470 --> 22:10.510
We don't know what we did, but we're sorry.

22:19.100 --> 22:20.980
Clarus Tonitrus.

22:22.360 --> 22:24.020
That's my name.

22:26.660 --> 22:28.820
Feeling your heart

22:28.820 --> 22:37.580
hito wa umarenagara hikari to kage wo

22:28.820 --> 22:37.580
It's natural for us all to be followed

22:37.580 --> 22:43.590
matoi tsuzukeru

22:37.580 --> 22:43.590
by light and shadow

22:43.590 --> 22:47.090
The lonely one

22:49.260 --> 22:51.300
Feeling your heart

22:51.300 --> 23:00.020
You can obtain all you've ever wanted

22:51.350 --> 23:00.060
hoshii mono subete te ni ireru koto

23:00.020 --> 23:06.280
sore ga shiawase nano

23:00.020 --> 23:06.280
But is that truly happiness?

23:06.280 --> 23:11.240
darekaga egao nara

23:06.280 --> 23:11.240
If someone is smiling,

23:11.240 --> 23:17.750
dokokade kitto naiteru hito ga ite

23:11.240 --> 23:17.750
somewhere, someone else is probably crying

23:17.750 --> 23:23.960
surechigau hodo itooshiku omou

23:17.750 --> 23:23.960
As our paths continue to cross,

23:23.960 --> 23:28.760
kimochi ga aru

23:23.960 --> 23:28.760
our love grows stronger

23:28.760 --> 23:33.760
hitotoki no aida ni

23:28.760 --> 23:33.760
In that short span of time

23:33.760 --> 23:40.270
bokura wa minna mujun wo dakishimete

23:33.760 --> 23:40.270
we embrace all contradictions

23:40.270 --> 23:48.400
as we watch the lights that lead us to tomorrow

23:40.310 --> 23:48.450
ashita e no hikari wo mitsume nagara

23:48.400 --> 23:53.580
aruiteku no kana

23:48.400 --> 23:53.580
I wonder if we'll keep walking this path

23:56.870 --> 24:00.660
Something strange attacks us while we're out shopping!

24:00.660 --> 24:03.580
And it's not a demonic plot, it's...

24:03.580 --> 24:06.510
Eh? Fox spirits and raccoon spirits?

24:06.510 --> 24:08.800
Next time, "A Special Kind of Ordinary."

24:08.800 --> 24:10.960
That ordinariness is kind of special!
